## Active AI Guardrails

These rules were learned from past sessions. Apply them to every response:

- **[HIGH] acknowledge-and-correct-immediately**: Verify flags before running commands
- **[MEDIUM] honor-user-preferences**: Prefer pytest fixtures over unittest
- **[MEDIUM] complete-all-parts-of-request**: Answer all parts of multi-part prompts

